==Strategy==
This is a timed stage, your goal is to push all the Prisoner Cats behind the enemy base before getting overrun by the angelic peon spam.

The role composition of your lineup should be similar to that of the previous stage: Strong rushers and bulky (not slow) attackers. Cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] excel at this role.

Note that most mid-range attackers, especially ones with low health will get sniped, and won't be very effective here.

If you're struggling, consider bringing Unit Attack and Worker Cat Start Level Up [[Cat Combo]]s.

